<section id="como-pedir" class="tk-section tk-process">
  <div class="tk-container">
    <div class="tk-process__head" data-reveal>
      <p class="tk-kicker">CÓMO FUNCIONA</p>
      <h2>¿Cómo hacer <em>tu pedido?</em></h2>
      <p>Cuéntanos qué necesitas y te compartiremos el precio y la fecha de entrega antes de confirmar.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="tk-process__grid">
      <article class="tk-process__step" data-reveal style="--tk-delay:0ms">
        <div class="tk-process__number">01</div>
        <div class="tk-process__symbol" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="32" height="32" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.55" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M4 20h4l10.5-10.5a2.1 2.1 0 0 0-3-3L5 17v3Z"/><path d="m13.5 6.5 4 4"/></svg></div>
        <h3>Cuéntanos tu idea</h3>
        <p>Envíanos una descripción, referencias, cantidad y fecha deseada.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="tk-process__step" data-reveal style="--tk-delay:100ms">
        <div class="tk-process__number">02</div>
        <div class="tk-process__symbol" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="32" height="32" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.55" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 2.8c.95 5.85 3.55 8.45 9.4 9.4-5.85.95-8.45 3.55-9.4 9.4-.95-5.85-3.55-8.45-9.4-9.4 5.85-.95 8.45-3.55 9.4-9.4Z"/></svg></div>
        <h3>Revisamos opciones</h3>
        <p>Te compartimos las opciones de personalización y la cotización.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="tk-process__step" data-reveal style="--tk-delay:200ms">
        <div class="tk-process__number">03</div>
        <div class="tk-process__symbol" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="32" height="32" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.55" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20.84 4.61a5.5 5.5 0 0 0-7.78 0L12 5.67l-1.06-1.06a5.5 5.5 0 0 0-7.78 7.78L12 21.23l8.84-8.84a5.5 5.5 0 0 0 0-7.78Z"/></svg></div>
        <h3>Confirmamos contigo</h3>
        <p>Revisamos contigo los detalles y confirmamos el pedido.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="tk-process__step" data-reveal style="--tk-delay:300ms">
        <div class="tk-process__number">04</div>
        <div class="tk-process__symbol" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="32" height="32" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.55" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="m12 3 8 4.5v9L12 21l-8-4.5v-9L12 3Z"/><path d="m4 7.5 8 4.5 8-4.5M12 12v9"/></svg></div>
        <h3>¡Manos a la obra!</h3>
        <p>Preparamos el trabajo y te avisamos cuando esté listo.</p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
